Article 4 (Relationship to other statutes)
Where the former Enforcement Decree of the Fisheries Act, the former Enforcement Decree of the Inland Water Fisheries Act, the former Enforcement Decree of the Seed Industry Act, or any of the provisions thereof are cited in other statutes as at the time this Decree enters into force, and this Decree includes any provision corresponding thereto, this Decree or the relevant provision of this Decree shall be deemed cited in lieu of the former Enforcement Decree of the Fisheries Act, the former Enforcement Decree of the Inland Water Fisheries Act, the former Enforcement Decree of the Seed Industry Act, or the relevant provision thereof.

